影响\"\n  }\n]\n\n    Item 2:\n    research_object: \"非小细胞肺癌(NSClC)接受Nivolumab治疗患者队列\"\n    result_or_measure: \"Overall Survival (OS) 与 Progression-Free Survival (PFS)\"\n    setting_or_time: \"回顾性单中心队列 (n=140)\"\n    groups: [\n  {\n    \"group\": \"Piperacillin/tazobactam (PTZ)\",\n    \"value\": \"OS HR = 3.31; PFS HR = 3.40\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"group\": \"Fluoroquinolones (<2周疗程)\",\n    \"value\": \"OS HR = 4.85; PFS 多变量分析中无一致显著性\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"group\": \"Third-generation cephalosporins\",\n    \"value\": \"OS 关联受疗程驱动; PFS 多变量分析中无一致显著性\"\n  }\n]\n\n    Check constraint: \"一组一数成对，不用多组名字对应一串数字；总体与分层比较、不同指标或结果分别记录。\" -> I'll split them if needed, but the prompt says `groups` is an array of `{group, value}`. I'll keep it as structured above. It matches.\n\n    Check constraint: \"reported_statistics 记录原文给出的统计量（没报告才留空）。\" -> I didn't include it in the template, but I should add it if present. The prompt says `reported_statistics` record original stats. I'll add it to each item or at the top. Actually, the prompt says `reported_statistics 记录原文给出的统计量`. I'll put it inside the items or as a separate field if allowed, but the JSON schema isn't strictly defined except for the listed fields. I'll just follow the exact field names requested: `quantitative_comparisons`, `usable_content`, `decision`, `still_missing`, `read_focus`, `external_ask`, `reason`. I'll embed stats in `groups` or add `reported_statistics` as a field if needed. The prompt says \"reported_statistics 记录原文给出的统计量（没报告才留空）\". I will add it as a key in the JSON output alongside the others, or inside the quantitative_comparisons items. I'll stick to the requested order: `quantitative_comparisons`, `usable_content`, `decision`, `still_missing`, `read_focus`, `external_ask`, `reason`. I'll put `reported_statistics` inside the `quantitative_comparisons` array items for clarity, or just list it separately if the prompt implies it's a top-level field. The prompt says \"返回 JSON，按此顺序写字段：quantitative_comparisons（无数